<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta is courting US investment in rare-earth mining while China remains dependent on Myanmar’s rare-earths for its supply chains, and ASEAN pressure on the regime is rising. The military seized a key resistance headquarters and ten opposition bases, and tightened rice shipment controls along the Taungoo-Leiktho route. Myanmar summoned the German envoy over a controversial video and the Thai foreign minister met Min Aung Hlaing to discuss border security, while the Chamber of Mines pledged US$400,000 for Burma Camp redevelopment. There were 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPZl9XaGdMNHJBNTVxcTNBOG1TWW5iRlllRmExM0o5Y2VCT0llS1ZuZGxRV1lZcTNDUGQyMjFQSlhYajQwNUxVQ0xRSldHU3NzRjdDdmFjMm9sdUlVMm1pN2NxM19zZkVaT1hzMlJETVF4R0tEZlF0MkFVV0I5T0I0WEo1c0wyZGEtaVZub2dOMXRqYmV2ekdnMUp2alZCT3FuMHcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business &amp;amp; Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi--?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOeGRlYnlQbHM3T3hGeWNXdHpuWWNnejNxWmVnbE1UTE1QLXFTa1BKRW9UUTdZTTJiQkxPVXR4cldabHRzdW9GUl9MbjF3YmR6czB4MUhiVWd0WFJyNXBXdVZ5U2lJdkJVOHZTMWVBY3oxbUtId1UxdENLNUVPYW1iUE5ROEpITjN1SmEzcUhuQjNBbXNiRzFYc3AwMkVRRUNnVVRxSTNOOVVVUHl0V3pGNmFLYXIwOUZY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOVjc3QWRDUklrOV9VNnRMc1JKN0FtV3JZV3BqT0FjT2FPelYxOTlXOHU4NENOLURZdFBHeEhjYWtXdFkyeVRZdWRKUGdjeFNxYTY0RllCUGJZaE81ZUFfbFdkd0g5dzljMXFUMl9vaEoyeHU3SmNnNVEzVC1tV2pHbUJ0RWhfYlZnVVJ2ZndfWlU5czR3WHdxSHBjQVdPTmowZXNpTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Variety&lt;